{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 1",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-577889204873200570 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/c80c08-d3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=577889204856423354&sectionId=577889204873200570)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkL_vXdmlc_text","label":"ggkL_vXdmlc_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#5594E7;\"><strong>Do you have any questions? We’re happy to help! Email us at &nbsp;</strong></span><a href=\"mailto:info@Shopvetpets.com\"><span style=\"color:#5594E7;\"><strong>info@Shopvetpets.com</strong></span></a><br>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7EExX0OcM_text","label":"gg7EExX0OcM_text","default":"<i>\"I thought it was just bad breath – until the vet explained what it could lead to. <strong>I will never ignore it again 🩵\"</strong></i>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEKyY0SfQK_text","label":"ggEKyY0SfQK_text","default":"<p><strong>Sarah Thompson, 44, Manchester</strong><br>🐾 Dog mom to Bella, a 7-year-old Cavalier King Charles Spaniel</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><i>25 May 2025</i></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggV7Ed2OWVJ_text","label":"ggV7Ed2OWVJ_text","default":"<p>I love Bella more than anything. She sleeps by my side every night 🩵</p><p>But over several months, I noticed her bad breath getting worse. At first, I thought it was just part of getting older.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>I tried dental chews, toothpaste, and even a special gel – but the smell always came back.<br>When I tried brushing her teeth, it was a constant struggle. She squirmed, licked away the toothpaste – and I eventually gave up.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>It wasn’t until I looked closely and saw that her gums were red and swollen that I started to get really worried.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>The vet said:<br><strong>“This isn’t just bad breath – it’s inflammation. And it hurts.”</strong><br>&nbsp;</p><p>I got a lump in my stomach. She could have been in pain for months – and I hadn’t realized it.<br><strong>I felt like such a bad dog mom... 😔</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggD3IccTFwP_text","label":"ggD3IccTFwP_text","default":"<span style=\"font-size:29px;\"><i>\"I didn’t know what to do!\"</i></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSrno-AKE3_text","label":"ggSrno-AKE3_text","default":"<p>As I sat at the vet with Bella on my lap, I felt both worried and guilty.<br>I hesitantly said:</p><p><i>\"We’ve never really managed to brush her teeth… she really doesn’t like it.\"</i><br>&nbsp;</p><p>The vet smiled gently.</p><p><i>\"You’re not alone. Most dogs don’t like it. But there are easier ways to prevent problems that I think you should try.\"</i><br>&nbsp;</p><p>She picked up a small jar and pulled out a <strong>moist finger wipe</strong>.<br>&nbsp;</p><p><i>\"You just swipe this over the teeth – it only takes a few seconds.\"</i><br>&nbsp;</p><p>She gently ran the wipe along Bella’s teeth.<br><strong>No struggle. No pulling. Bella sat calmly.</strong></p><p>We both looked a bit surprised – I don’t think even Bella expected it to be that easy.</p><p><br>The vet smiled and said:<br><i>\"And doing this regularly is all it takes.\"</i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLtdPRxgvc_label","label":"ggLtdPRxgvc_label","default":"<p>Check Availability</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_22YPeAPS_text","label":"gg_22YPeAPS_text","default":"“Jag testade direkt när vi kom hem.”"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvOzRX72Ip_text","label":"ggvOzRX72Ip_text","default":"<p>The next day I picked up the wipe myself.</p><p>I was a little hesitant – I thought maybe it only worked that well at the vet’s office because Bella was shocked.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>But it worked just as smoothly at home!<br><br>I had her sit in my lap, swiped over her teeth – and we were done in a few seconds.</p><p>Bella mostly looked like she was waiting for a treat afterwards… 😅<br>&nbsp;</p><p>It felt unreal. <strong>No struggle. No guilt. Just done.</strong></p><p>And when I saw how much dirt had come off on the wipe…<br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>That’s when I realized how bad it actually was – and how easily it could have been avoided.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWJTwbZG2J_text","label":"ggWJTwbZG2J_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong>Why are dental problems so common – and so hard to prevent?</strong></span><br><br>De flesta hundägare kämpar med rutiner.<br>Borsta tänderna varje dag? För många är det praktiskt omöjligt.</p><p>Plack bygger upp, bakterier frodas. Och utan behandling förvandlas plack till tandsten – vilket kan leda till tandlossning och dyra veterinärbesök.</p><p><strong>FreshWipes gör det enkelt att bryta den spiralen.</strong><br>Du sveper bort plack med fingret – utan borste eller stress.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gga1s1BQP0V_label","label":"gga1s1BQP0V_label","default":"<p>Check Availability</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmiQpo080o_text","label":"ggmiQpo080o_text","default":"<i>\"</i><strong>\"Today Bella feels great again! 🩵 And I feel so much better as a dog mom.\"</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8SRACmCQa_text","label":"gg8SRACmCQa_text","default":"<p>Now I use FreshWipes 3 times a week in the evenings, it only takes us 1 minute each time – and we both enjoy it more and more!<br>&nbsp;</p><p>Bella’s breath is now so much fresher. She sits calmly when I clean her teeth, <strong>and I think it’s because she feels my finger and feels safe 🩵</strong><br>&nbsp;</p><p>I truly feel like a better dog mom now – and Bella feels great!</p><p><strong>There’s only one thing I regret…</strong><br><strong>That I didn’t start earlier!</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggatCpvPna2_label","label":"ggatCpvPna2_label","default":"<p>I want FreshWipes</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggolDB5EKKb_text","label":"ggolDB5EKKb_text","default":"Right now up